          <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:#a1a1aa;margin:0;line-height:1.65">Open ihatepdf.cv/gst-invoice, enter your business details, your customer's details and the line items. CGST, SGST and IGST are calculated automatically based on whether the supply is intra-state or inter-state, an HSN/SAC summary is generated, and you download a compliant Tax Invoice as a PDF. Free, no account, no subscription, and your billing data never leaves your device.</p>
